[C1] PASS each of the four guards restores du and w bit for bit, returns a zero correction and latches: inputs restored, sentinel restored, results restored, correction restored
[C2] PASS after a failure at stage 0 the later stages of the step return zero without solving: solves run 1 of 3 stages; max |correction| per stage [0.0, 0.0, 0.0]
[C3] PASS a failed step raises redo cause 32; the stage-0 reset lets the retry solve again: cause mask 32; retry mask 0, retry max |correction| 2.97
[C4] PASS one failed column of 4 returns a zero correction for every column of the block; no column is partly updated: max |correction| without the failure 0.466, with it 0; du unchanged: True
